asset:        110-text-A.aepx
title:        After Effects XML project (.aepx) fixture: base project plus a text layer containing the letter A
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-18 by vangel76
notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 from scratch (one scripted change per file) as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests: the XML form (.aepx) of the same project state as the .aep fixture of the same name, saved right after it; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The file is as After Effects wrote it, except that the XMP packet inside ProjectXMPMetadata was replaced by the packet of the .aep fixture (the base project's) to keep the fixtures small and free of save history.
